1. Executive Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 SocietyOS is a comprehensive, ad-free society facility management platform designed to digitise and streamline all operations within residential gated communities. The platform consists of three interconnected applications:\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs20 \cf5 Application\
Target Users\
Platform\
Primary Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Resident App\
Residents & Apartment Owners\
iOS & Android\
Day-to-day community living, services & payments\
Staff App\
On-ground Service Staff & Security\
Android (Primary)\
Task management, attendance & communications\
Admin Portal\
Society Management Committee & Admin\
Web + Mobile App\
Full operational oversight & reporting\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 SocietyOS goes beyond existing solutions like MyGate by adding utility service management, community canteen menus, event management, medical SOS & appointment booking, complaints management, property sale requests, maintenance payments, and travel pause requests \'97 all with zero advertisements.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \page \
2. Product Overview\
2.1 Vision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 To become the most comprehensive, resident-centric platform for managing life in a gated community \'97 eliminating paper-based processes, reducing friction between residents and management, and empowering service staff with modern digital tools.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.2 Problem Statement\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Residents face fragmented experiences across multiple apps and manual processes for different community needs.\
	\'95	Service staff have no digital tool to manage tasks, attendance, or performance feedback.\
	\'95	Society admins lack real-time visibility into operations, complaints, and financials.\
	\'95	Existing apps like MyGate focus heavily on security but miss deeper community and service layers.\
	\'95	Ads in existing apps create a poor user experience for a captive audience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 2.3 Target Users\
Residents\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Apartment owners and tenants living in gated communities.\
	\'95	Age group: 25-65 years; varying digital literacy.\
	\'95	Need: convenience, transparency, and quick access to services.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Service Staff\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Maintenance workers, security guards, housekeeping, plumbers, electricians, carpenters.\
	\'95	Age group: 20-50 years; basic smartphone users.\
	\'95	Need: simple task management, proof-of-work tools, leave management.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Admin / Management Committee\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Elected members, property managers, facility managers.\
	\'95	Need: dashboards, reports, control over services and residents.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
