3. App 1 \'97 Resident Mobile App\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb120\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf5   TARGET PLATFORM: iOS & Android  |  USERS: Residents & Apartment Owners  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 3.1 Core Modules (Parity with MyGate + Enhancements)\
3.1.1 Visitor & Gate Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Pre-approve visitors with QR code / OTP-based entry.\
	\'95	Real-time notification on visitor arrival at gate.\
	\'95	Track visitor log and history.\
	\'95	Delivery management: expected deliveries, missed delivery alerts.\
	\'95	Cab & vehicle pre-approval for gate pass.\
	\'95	Domestic help / frequent visitor management with recurring approvals.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.1.2 Security & Alerts\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Real-time security guard communication.\
	\'95	Emergency broadcasts from admin to all residents.\
	\'95	Suspicious activity reporting.\
	\'95	CCTV access for registered residents (if enabled by admin).\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.1.3 Society Notices & Communication\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Bulletin board for official society announcements.\
	\'95	Community polls and voting on society decisions.\
	\'95	Neighbour-to-neighbour messaging within community.\
	\'95	Discussion forums for residents.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2 New Features (Beyond MyGate)\
3.2.1 Utility Service Request Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Residents can raise requests for skilled services within the community.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Browse available services: Plumber, Electrician, Carpenter, Painter, Pest Control, Appliance Repair, etc.\
	\'95	View service provider profiles: name, photo, specialisation, average rating.\
	\'95	Book a service with preferred date and time slot.\
	\'95	Real-time status tracking: Requested > Assigned > In Progress > Completed.\
	\'95	Receive push notifications at each stage transition.\
	\'95	Rate and review the service upon completion (1-5 stars + text review).\
	\'95	View history of all past service requests.\
	\'95	Raise repeat requests from history with one tap.\
	\'95	Admin-managed service catalog: admin controls which services are available.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.2 Community Canteen\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Digital menu and meal rating for the community canteen / mess.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View today's menu: Breakfast, Lunch, Snacks, Dinner.\
	\'95	Weekly menu view with day-by-day breakdown.\
	\'95	Calorie and allergen information per dish (if entered by admin).\
	\'95	Pre-order meals for specific time slots (if enabled by admin).\
	\'95	Rate individual dishes: 1-5 stars + comments.\
	\'95	View most popular dishes based on community ratings.\
	\'95	Admin-managed menu: canteen staff update daily/weekly menus.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.3 Event Management \'96 Marzi organized. \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Community event discovery and registration.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Browse upcoming events organised\
	\'95	View event details: name, date, time, venue, description, organiser.\
	\'95	Register / RSVP for events with one tap.\
	\'95	View number of people registered for each event.\
	\'95	See list of neighbours attending the same event.\
	\'95	Receive reminders 24 hours and 1 hour before the event.\
	\'95	Post-event feedback and rating.\
	\'95	Admin creates and manages events; resident-led events subject to admin approval.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.4 Medical SOS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Instant emergency alert system for medical situations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Prominent SOS button on the home screen.\
	\'95	On press: alerts go to the medical help desk, security gate, and designated first responders simultaneously.\
	\'95	Includes resident name, flat number, and GPS location.\
	\'95	Two-way acknowledgement: resident sees when help has been acknowledged.\
	\'95	SOS log maintained for admin review.\
	\'95	Configurable alert contacts by admin (can include external emergency services).\
	\'95	Confirm SOS or cancel within 5 seconds to prevent false alarms.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.5 Medical Help Desk Appointments\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Book appointments with on-site medical staff or visiting doctors.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View available doctors/nurses and their visiting schedules.\
	\'95	Book appointment with preferred date and time slot.\
	\'95	View upcoming and past appointments.\
	\'95	Receive confirmation and reminders.\
	\'95	Cancel or reschedule with advance notice.\
	\'95	Telehealth / video consultation option (if enabled by admin).\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.6 Complaints Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Structured system for raising, tracking, and resolving complaints.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Raise a complaint with category (Water, Electricity, Lift, Parking, Noise, Cleanliness, etc.).\
	\'95	Attach photos and descriptions.\
	\'95	Track complaint status: Raised > Under Review > Assigned > Resolved > Closed.\
	\'95	Receive notifications at each status change.\
	\'95	Escalate unresolved complaints after a set period.\
	\'95	Rate resolution quality upon closure.\
	\'95	View past complaints and resolutions.\
	\'95	Anonymous complaint submission option.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.7 Staff Help Requests\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Request assistance from society staff for common tasks.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Request types: Help with heavy items, Document collection, Package pickup, etc.\
	\'95	Assign request to available staff.\
	\'95	Real-time status: Requested > Assigned > Completed.\
	\'95	Rate the staff assistance after completion.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.8 Maintenance Payments\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Digital payment of monthly/quarterly society maintenance dues.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View maintenance dues: current, past-due, and advance.\
	\'95	View itemised breakdown of charges (maintenance, water, parking, etc.).\
	\'95	Pay via UPI, Net Banking, Debit/Credit Card, Wallet.\
	\'95	Download official receipts / invoices.\
	\'95	Set up auto-pay for recurring payments.\
	\'95	View complete payment history.\
	\'95	Late payment interest calculation displayed transparently.\
	\'95	Receive reminders before due date.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.9 Property Sale Request\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Residents can formally express intent to sell their property through the society.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Submit property sale listing: flat number, area, asking price, contact details.\
	\'95	Admin approves / rejects listing before it goes live on a community board.\
	\'95	Interested buyers (other residents) can express interest through the app.\
	\'95	Admin can facilitate introduction between seller and buyer.\
	\'95	Status tracking: Under Review > Approved > Listed > Under Negotiation > Sold.\
	\'95	Option to remove listing at any time.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.2.10 Travel Mode (Maintenance Pause)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Residents travelling for extended periods can request a pause on certain variable charges.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Submit travel request: travel start date, expected return date, reason (optional).\
	\'95	Specify which services to pause (e.g., newspaper, milk, canteen meals).\
	\'95	Admin reviews and approves the travel pause.\
	\'95	Maintenance dues paused/reduced per society rules.\
	\'95	Auto-activation on return date; resident can also manually mark return.\
	\'95	Push notification reminder 1 day before scheduled return.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 3.3 Resident App \'97 Non-Functional Requirements\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs20 \cf5 Requirement\
Specification\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Platforms\
iOS 14+ and Android 8.0+\
Ads\
Zero advertisements \'97 completely ad-free experience\
Performance\
App launch < 2 seconds; API responses < 1.5 seconds on 4G\
Offline Mode\
View past data, raise offline complaints synced when online\
Push Notifications\
Real-time via FCM / APNs; user can configure per category\
Accessibility\
WCAG 2.1 AA compliant; supports system font scaling\
Languages\
English and regional language support (Hindi, Kannada, Tamil, etc.)\
Security\
End-to-end encryption; OTP-based login; biometric auth support\
Privacy\
PDPA / IT Act compliant; no data sold to third parties; no ads profiling\
Onboarding\
Resident verified by admin before app access; OTP + flat verification\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \page \
4. App 2 \'97 Staff Mobile App\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb120\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf5   TARGET PLATFORM: Android (Primary)  |  USERS: On-ground Service & Security Staff  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 The Staff App empowers community service workers with digital tools to manage their daily work, track performance, and communicate within the staff community. It is designed for ease-of-use by users with basic digital literacy.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.1 Attendance & Shift Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Daily login/logout with location verification (within community geofence).\
	\'95	Biometric or face-ID based check-in (if hardware is available).\
	\'95	Shift schedule view: today, this week, upcoming.\
	\'95	View total hours worked per day, week, and month.\
	\'95	Overtime tracking with admin approval.\
	\'95	Late arrival and early departure flagging with reason submission.\
	\'95	Attendance summary available for download.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.2 Task & Service Request Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View list of service requests assigned by admin (plumbing, carpentry, cleaning, etc.).\
	\'95	See request details: resident name, flat, description, photos attached by resident.\
	\'95	Mark task as Accepted > In Progress > Completed.\
	\'95	Upload before and after photos as proof of work.\
	\'95	Add notes/comments to a task.\
	\'95	Reject a task with reason (escalates to admin).\
	\'95	View full history of completed tasks.\
	\'95	Real-time notification when a new task is assigned.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.3 Reviews & Ratings\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View ratings and reviews received from residents for completed tasks.\
	\'95	See overall performance score and trend over time.\
	\'95	Flag inappropriate reviews to admin.\
	\'95	Receive notification when a new review is posted.\
	\'95	Admin-visible performance leaderboard (configurable).\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.4 Leave & Holiday Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Apply for leave: casual, medical, privilege leave.\
	\'95	Select leave dates and submit reason.\
	\'95	Track leave status: Pending > Approved / Rejected.\
	\'95	View remaining leave balance by type.\
	\'95	View official society holidays calendar.\
	\'95	Admin approval workflow for all leave requests.\
	\'95	Notification on leave approval or rejection.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.5 Proof of Work \'97 Photo Upload\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Upload multiple photos per task (before/after/during).\
	\'95	Photos are geotagged and timestamped automatically.\
	\'95	Photos are attached to the task record visible to admin.\
	\'95	Compressed upload to save mobile data.\
	\'95	Option to add a voice note or text note alongside photo.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.6 Staff Community Platform\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A dedicated internal communication channel for staff members.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Team announcements from admin/supervisor.\
	\'95	Staff notice board: policy updates, safety alerts, schedule changes.\
	\'95	Staff-to-staff messaging (within approved groups).\
	\'95	Training materials and how-to guides uploaded by admin.\
	\'95	Recognition / shoutout board: admin can highlight good performers.\
	\'95	Staff welfare notices (health camps, benefits, etc.).\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.7 Staff Profile & Documents\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	View personal profile: name, ID, designation, team.\
	\'95	Upload and view employment documents.\
	\'95	View salary slips and payment history.\
	\'95	Emergency contact information management.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 4.8 Staff App \'97 Non-Functional Requirements\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs20 \cf5 Requirement\
Specification\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Platform\
Android 8.0+; lightweight APK < 30MB for low-end devices\
Language\
Simple interface with regional language support (Hindi + local languages)\
Connectivity\
Offline mode for task viewing; syncs on reconnection\
Data Usage\
Low data mode for photo compression; works on 2G/3G\
Authentication\
PIN-based login; biometric if device supports it\
Security\
Staff data isolated per community; RBAC enforced\
Accessibility\
Large tap targets; high contrast; voice-over support\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \page \
5. App 3 \'97 Admin Portal (Web + Mobile)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sb120\sa120\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf5   TARGET PLATFORM: Web Portal + Mobile App  |  USERS: Management Committee & Admin Staff  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sb80\sa80\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 The Admin Portal is the operational brain of SocietyOS. It provides real-time visibility, control, and reporting across all resident and staff activities.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 5.1 Dashboard & Analytics\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Unified dashboard: total residents, active complaints, pending service requests, upcoming events, today's attendance.\
	\'95	Financial snapshot: total dues collected, outstanding maintenance, recent transactions.\
	\'95	Activity feed: latest events across all modules in real time.\
	\'95	Quick action shortcuts: post notice, create event, approve request, send alert.\
	\'95	Charts and trend graphs: complaint resolution times, service ratings, canteen usage, payment compliance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 5.2 Resident Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Onboard residents: link residents to flat numbers, verify identity.\
	\'95	Manage tenant vs. owner profiles.\
	\'95	View resident activity, payment history, and complaint history.\
	\'95	Deactivate accounts (for vacated or sold flats).\
	\'95	Bulk communication: send messages to selected residents or all.\
	\'95	Export resident directory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 5.3 Staff Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Add, edit, deactivate staff profiles.\
	\'95	Assign staff to service categories (plumber, security, etc.).\
	\'95	View real-time attendance logs.\
	\'95	Approve / reject leave requests.\
	\'95	Assign tasks to specific staff members.\
	\'95	View and download staff performance reports.\
	\'95	Manage salary structures and payment records.\
	\'95	Upload and manage staff documents.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 5.4 Service Request Management\
