9. Security & Compliance Requirements\
9.1 Authentication & Authorisation\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	All users authenticated via OTP (phone number) as primary method.\
	\'95	Biometric fallback (fingerprint / face ID) on supported devices.\
	\'95	Admin accounts require 2FA (OTP + TOTP authenticator app).\
	\'95	Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) enforced across all modules.\
	\'95	Session management: auto-expiry after configurable idle period.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 9.2 Data Security\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	All data encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256).\
	\'95	PII data (resident details, medical records) stored with additional encryption.\
	\'95	API endpoints protected with rate limiting and DDoS protection.\
	\'95	SQL injection, XSS, CSRF protection on all input points.\
	\'95	Penetration testing conducted before go-live and annually.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 9.3 Privacy & Compliance\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Compliance with India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023.\
	\'95	Explicit consent collected during onboarding for data processing.\
	\'95	Data minimisation: only collect data necessary for each feature.\
	\'95	Right to data deletion: residents can request account deletion.\
	\'95	No resident data sold, rented, or used for ad targeting.\
	\'95	Data retention policy: active data retained as long as resident is active; anonymised after 3 years of inactivity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 9.4 Multi-Tenancy\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Each society is an isolated tenant; no data leakage between societies.\
	\'95	Society-level database partitioning or separate schemas.\
	\'95	Admin from Society A cannot access Society B data under any circumstance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
