11. Assumptions & Constraints\
11.1 Assumptions\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Each society will have a dedicated admin who manages the platform.\
	\'95	Society residents own smartphones (Android or iOS).\
	\'95	Internet connectivity is available within the society premises (Wi-Fi).\
	\'95	Payment gateway (Razorpay) operates within existing regulatory framework.\
	\'95	Society has an existing bank account for maintenance payments to flow into.\
	\'95	Medical help desk is a pre-existing facility within the community (the app connects to it, does not create it).\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 11.2 Constraints\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	The platform must work on mid-range Android devices (2GB RAM and above).\
	\'95	App size must not exceed 50MB for Resident App; 30MB for Staff App.\
	\'95	No dependency on hardware not already available in the community (geofencing uses GPS, not RFID).\
	\'95	Biometric hardware integration is optional and depends on what the society installs.\
	\'95	Regulatory compliance with DPDP Act must be met before launch.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 11.3 Out of Scope\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\sb40\sa40\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 	\'95	Property rental listing and management (future phase).\
	\'95	Grocery delivery or food ordering (external service; not a canteen feature).\
	\'95	HR payroll processing (payslip view is in scope; payroll calculation is out of scope).\
	\'95	Construction or renovation project management.\
	\'95	Integration with municipal water / electricity utilities.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
